# SOP_SCD_PM_01 — Problem Management: Preventive Task Tracking on GitHub (v1)

## General Document Information

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Document ID | SOP_SCD_PM_01 |
| Document Owner | Lopez Cross, Sebastian |
| Current Version | 1.0 |

---

## Purpose

Track Preventive Tasks derived from Problem Records (PRs) managed in **ServiceNow**
within the sovereign GitHub boundary.

- Problem Records are created and managed in **ServiceNow**.
- Preventive Tasks derived from those Problem Records are tracked in **GitHub**.
- Each Problem Record is represented by a **Parent Issue** in GitHub.
- Each Preventive Task is a **Sub-issue** linked to the Parent Issue.
- Multiple Preventive Tasks per Problem Record may be assigned to **different teams**.

---

## Two-Level Issue Structure

```
📋 PARENT ISSUE — Problem Record Tracker (PRB0110337)
│
├── 📌 Sub-issue 1 — Preventive Task 1 (Team A)
├── 📌 Sub-issue 2 — Preventive Task 2 (Team B)
├── 📌 Sub-issue 3 — Preventive Task 3 (Team A)
├── 📌 Sub-issue 4 — Preventive Task 4 (Team C)
└── 📌 Sub-issue 5 — Preventive Task 5 (Team B)
```

