## Template 2 — Sub-issue: `preventive-task.yml`

```yaml
name: Preventive Task
description: >
  Create a Preventive Task derived from a Problem Record (PR) in ServiceNow.
  This Issue must be linked to a parent Problem Record Tracker Issue.
title: "[PT] <PRB number> — <short task description>"
labels:
  - "PT:New"
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ---
        # 🛡 Preventive Task
        ---
        This Issue represents a single **Preventive Task** derived from a
        **Problem Record (PR)** in ServiceNow.
        > ℹ **Link this Issue to the parent Problem Record Tracker** using
        > the **Parent Issue** Project field after submitting.
        > This Issue will be worked by the **assigned team** independently
        > from other Preventive Tasks under the same PR.

  - type: input
    id: pr-number
    attributes:
      label: "* Problem Record Number (ServiceNow)"
      description: >
        The ServiceNow Problem Record number this task is derived from.
      placeholder: "PRB0110337"
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: pt-number
    attributes:
      label: ServiceNow Task Number (if available)
      description: >
        The ServiceNow Preventive Task number if already created there.
      placeholder: "PTASK1170332"
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: input
    id: component
    attributes:
      label: Component
      placeholder: "GCID-NW-010"
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: input
    id: service-offering
    attributes:
      label: Service Offering
      placeholder: "GCID-Network-WAN-Edge"
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: dropdown
    id: priority
    attributes:
      label: "* Priority"
      options:
        - 1 - Very High
        - 2 - High
        - 3 - Moderate
        - 4 - Low
        - 5 - Planning
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: dropdown
    id: data-processing-security
    attributes:
      label: Data Processing & Security
      options:
        - NONE
        - Personal Data
        - Sensitive Personal Data
        - Confidential
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: dropdown
    id: pt-category
    attributes:
      label: Preventive Task Category
      options:
        - "-- None --"
        - Configuration Change
        - Patch / Update
        - Process Improvement
        - Monitoring Enhancement
        - Documentation Update
        - Training
        - Infrastructure Hardening
        - Other
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: input
    id: assignment-group
    attributes:
      label: "* Assignment Group"
      description: The team responsible for this Preventive Task.
      placeholder: "e.g. Network Team / Security Team / Basis Team"
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: due-date
    attributes:
      label: "* Due Date"
      description: Due date for this specific Preventive Task (YYYY-MM-DD).
      placeholder: "YYYY-MM-DD"
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: input
    id: subject
    attributes:
      label: "* Subject"
      description: Short descriptive title for this Preventive Task.
      placeholder: "e.g. Update BGP routing policy on WAN-Edge devices"
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: description
    attributes:
      label: "* Description"
      description: >
        Full description of what needs to be done, why, and how.
      placeholder: |
        - What needs to be done:
        - Why (link to root cause):
        - How (high-level approach):
        - Success criteria:
    validations:
      required: true

  - type: textarea
    id: preventive-measure
    attributes:
      label: Preventive Measure
      description: Describe the preventive measure this task implements.
      placeholder: |
        - Preventive measure description:
        - How this prevents recurrence:
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: checkboxes
    id: customer-rca
    attributes:
      label: Enable for Customer RCA Use
      options:
        - label: >
            This Preventive Task is approved for inclusion in
            Customer RCA reporting.
          required: false

  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ---
        # 📋 Progress & Completion
        ---
        *This section is updated by the **Assigned Team** as work progresses.*

  - type: textarea
    id: progress-notes
    attributes:
      label: Progress Notes
      description: >
        Document progress updates, blockers, and decisions here.
        Add a new entry for each update — do not overwrite previous entries.
      placeholder: |
        ### Update — YYYY-MM-DD
        - **Status:**
        - **Progress:**
        - **Blockers:**
        - **Next steps:**
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: textarea
    id: completion-evidence
    attributes:
      label: Completion Evidence
      description: |
        Attach evidence that the Preventive Task has been completed.
        Drag & drop files, screenshots, or paste outputs directly here.
        🔒 Do **not** upload any Customer or Confidential Data.
      placeholder: |
        - **Completed by (Name / GitHub handle):**
        - **Completion timestamp (UTC):**
        - **Evidence:**
          <drag & drop files or paste outputs here>
        - **Outcome:**
    validations:
      required: false

  - type: checkboxes
    id: completion-checklist
    attributes:
      label: Completion Checklist
      options:
        - label: Task has been completed per the description above.
          required: false
        - label: Completion evidence has been attached.
          required: false
        - label: Progress notes are up to date.
          required: false
        - label: Parent Problem Record Tracker Issue has been updated.
          required: false
        - label: This Issue contains no Customer or Confidential Data.
          required: false

  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ---
        *End of Preventive Task — SOP_SCD_PM_01 v1.0*
        ---
```

